{"id":"43165f8108fcba25","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-conservativity-compression.md","title":"A Single Sentence Compresses Bounded Axioms","display":"thm-conservativity-compression — A Single Sentence Compresses Bounded Axioms","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-conservativity-compression","aliases":["67-thm-conservativity-compression"],"display":"thm-conservativity-compression — A Single Sentence Compresses Bounded Axioms","depends_on":["[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-PA]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":5,"source_label":"Theorem 4(a)","source_printed_pages":"66","source_pdf_pages":"77","source_proof_status":"Theorem 5.4(a) 陈述和依赖定位已核对；Lemma 5.2 的全部内部构造未独立完成"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-conservativity-compression"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-conservativity-compression</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-conservativity-compression — A Single Sentence Compresses Bounded Axioms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 4(a)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"66"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"77"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Theorem 5.4(a) 陈述和依赖定位已核对；Lemma 5.2 的全部内部构造未独立完成"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是一致原始递归呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})\">\\((\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n)\">\\((\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)\">\\((\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是递归可枚举公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a> 的演绎扩张定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\theta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_{\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}}(T\\cup\\{\\theta\\},T\\cup X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\theta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_{\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}}(T\\cup\\{\\theta\\},T\\cup X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 5.4(a)。新理论由一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 句给出，但能证明全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，且不增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+X\">\\(T+X\\)</span> 的对偶类后果。这里必须使用演绎扩张；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 一般不字面包含于单元素集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\theta\\}\">\\(\\{\\theta\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>陈述及其对 Craig 重新公理化、Lemma 5.2 的依赖已核对；未逐行验证该引理中的部分真／固定点构造。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+X\">\\(T+X\\)</span> 不一致，结论允许不一致压缩；没有偷偷增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+X\">\\(T+X\\)</span> 一致性前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是一致原始递归呈示，$n\\ge1$，$(\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})$ 为 $(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n)$ 或 $(\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)$（[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\subseteq\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是递归可枚举公理集；$\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma$ 采用 [[67-df-partially-conservative]] 的演绎扩张定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\theta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_{\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}}(T\\cup\\{\\theta\\},T\\cup X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"T+X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\theta\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T+X","display":false},{"tex":"T+X","display":false}],"bytes":1770,"backlinks":[{"id":"08ea1622d188e9e9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"对应印刷66页/PDF77页定理4(b)，与已有仅压缩一个给定 r.e. 句集的 [[67-thm-conservativity-compression]] 区分。这里存在同一个公式 $\\eta(x)$ 同时处理所有行参数 $k$；不是每个 $k$ 各自选择一句之后未证明选择可统一。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-conservativity-compression]]"}],"outgoing":["5d04e3c8a5885c18","851cd80e64893935","cd051851df5d2aa2"]}